The school has received a diploma issued to our IB DP student **Adam Koubek** for the successful representation of our school at the **international S.A.V.E. Ambassador competition**.

![Diploma awarded to Adam Koubek for the S.A.V.E. Ambassador competition](/images/news/save-ambassador-diploma.webp)

Congratulations, Adam. Taking part in an international competition alongside a full Diploma Programme workload asks for real commitment, and representing Česká this well is something the whole IB DP community can be proud of. We wish you the same confidence in everything that follows.
